WEBVTT

00:00:02.700 --> 00:00:08.820
<i>This is a tale of a girl born 
on a planet far, far away.</i>

00:00:25.340 --> 00:00:28.620
I was wondering where 
I might find you, Princess Yuki.

00:00:32.340 --> 00:00:33.400
Joshua!

00:00:33.850 --> 00:00:36.340
The time has come. 
You should begin the preparations.

00:00:41.220 --> 00:00:42.270
Ow!

00:00:41.400 --> 00:00:44.260
Quit acting all cool. It's not like you.

00:00:44.640 --> 00:00:46.900
Don't tell me you're nervous.

00:00:46.900 --> 00:00:48.070
I beg your pardon.

00:00:48.070 --> 00:00:51.730
It's not like you to be scared, either!

00:00:52.400 --> 00:00:54.420
H-How rude!

00:00:54.420 --> 00:00:57.110
I'm not the slightest bit nervous...

00:00:57.760 --> 00:00:58.870
Don't worry.

00:00:59.360 --> 00:01:01.120
Miss Layla and I will be with you.

00:01:01.390 --> 00:01:02.120
Right?

00:01:03.700 --> 00:01:04.620
Yes!

00:01:09.570 --> 00:01:11.970
You sure have grown, Yuki.

00:01:12.540 --> 00:01:13.630
Thank you.

00:01:14.100 --> 00:01:16.840
You're still really short, though, Joshua.

00:01:17.210 --> 00:01:18.410
Even though you're 15,

00:01:18.410 --> 00:01:20.120
you should be all grown up, right?

00:01:20.120 --> 00:01:21.420
Yeah, yeah.

00:01:21.420 --> 00:01:24.090
If you can still insult me 
like that, you must be fine.

00:01:43.960 --> 00:01:45.000
Magnificent.

00:01:45.580 --> 00:01:48.990
You've memorized the words 
of the ceremony, then?

00:01:48.990 --> 00:01:51.420
Y-Yes, Miss Layla!

00:01:51.420 --> 00:01:54.130
Good. Then let us proceed.

00:02:24.950 --> 00:02:27.620
Were you injured, Princess Yuki?

00:02:27.620 --> 00:02:30.670
N-No! I'm fine.

00:02:31.270 --> 00:02:32.660
I'm totally—

00:02:36.690 --> 00:02:38.330
Th-Thank you...

00:02:42.260 --> 00:02:45.680
Um... U-Um...

00:02:45.940 --> 00:02:48.560
Passion and will, Yuki.

00:02:49.330 --> 00:02:51.340
Everyone's waiting to hear from you.

00:02:51.340 --> 00:02:52.560
Go on and nail it.

00:02:59.650 --> 00:03:03.660
People of the Special State of Hariant, 
home of our royal family.

00:03:03.660 --> 00:03:07.500
I am grateful that you all 
came here for me today.

00:03:09.930 --> 00:03:12.950
I have turned twelve years old twelve.

00:03:13.420 --> 00:03:16.110
I vow to assume more responsibility

00:03:16.110 --> 00:03:19.810
and guide you all to ever greater prosperity!

00:03:29.560 --> 00:03:32.350
Kingdom of Soleil, be eternal!

00:03:32.530 --> 00:03:34.360
Be eternal!

00:03:41.030 --> 00:03:44.620
It was a questionable start, 
but you recovered well.

00:03:45.010 --> 00:03:46.610
Well done, Your Highness.

00:03:49.240 --> 00:03:52.000
Thank you, everyone!

00:03:55.540 --> 00:04:01.510
<b><i>The Girl From Soleil</i></b>

00:03:55.550 --> 00:03:57.320
<i>And now, our next story.</i>

00:03:57.330 --> 00:04:00.180
<i>The government has announced that 
a new kind of chrars in development</i>

00:04:00.180 --> 00:04:03.010
<i>has reached the practical utility stage.</i>

00:04:05.760 --> 00:04:08.510
Princess Yuki, happy birthday.

00:04:08.760 --> 00:04:10.100
To celebrate your special day.

00:04:10.430 --> 00:04:12.530
Yes, I leave it in your hands.

00:04:13.100 --> 00:04:14.440
Princess Yuki.

00:04:14.590 --> 00:04:15.730
Princess Yuki.

00:04:15.840 --> 00:04:16.980
Princess Yuki.

00:04:17.980 --> 00:04:18.610
In your hands!

00:04:18.890 --> 00:04:19.530
In your hands!

00:04:19.650 --> 00:04:20.150
In your hands!

00:04:20.400 --> 00:04:21.280
In your hands!

00:04:21.340 --> 00:04:21.900
In your hands!

00:04:23.290 --> 00:04:24.410
I'm exhausted!

00:04:24.750 --> 00:04:28.490
Things certainly seem more 
prosperous this year.

00:04:28.490 --> 00:04:31.520
They've likely heard the rumors 
of the new chrars,

00:04:31.520 --> 00:04:36.130
and are all eager to 
get it for their own domain.

00:04:36.130 --> 00:04:39.000
A new chrars?

00:04:39.000 --> 00:04:42.650
Then why don't we send each 
of them a little sample?

00:04:42.650 --> 00:04:44.710
Is it ready for that yet, Miss Layla?

00:04:44.710 --> 00:04:49.550
Its development status was in 
the report compiled by Advisor Izana.

00:04:49.550 --> 00:04:51.560
I-I couldn't finish it...

00:04:51.560 --> 00:04:54.440
I was just so focused on my 
speech for the ceremony...

00:04:54.710 --> 00:04:57.210
I will no longer treat you as a child.

00:04:57.210 --> 00:05:00.270
From now on, you must earnestly 
engage in the business of rule.

00:05:02.630 --> 00:05:03.890
What's this?

00:05:03.890 --> 00:05:05.280
Today's assignments.

00:05:05.650 --> 00:05:10.030
Revised budget for the term, drafts of 
legislative revisions, and related materials.

00:05:11.050 --> 00:05:13.890
Look through all of them by this evening, 
and mark them approved.

00:05:13.890 --> 00:05:15.910
No way! My fingerprint will be worn off!

00:05:16.230 --> 00:05:18.490
And as of this afternoon, 
you'll be participating in parliament.

00:05:18.490 --> 00:05:21.230
Please finish your lunch by two o'clock.

00:05:23.690 --> 00:05:27.290
C-C'mon, Miss Layla's only thinking of you...

00:05:27.290 --> 00:05:29.490
Joshua!

00:05:30.960 --> 00:05:32.890
Seriously, Yuki?

00:05:32.890 --> 00:05:35.710
Indulge me! We'll be back with time to spare!

00:05:46.680 --> 00:05:48.950
Father, Mother...

00:05:49.350 --> 00:05:50.630
Are you watching me?

00:05:51.080 --> 00:05:53.580
I'm twelve years old now.

00:05:54.110 --> 00:05:55.510
I'm all grown up, see?

00:05:55.830 --> 00:05:57.730
So don't worry about anything.

00:05:57.730 --> 00:05:59.330
I'm going to do this right.

00:05:59.890 --> 00:06:06.090
I'll see my princess duties 
through and make you proud.

00:06:07.850 --> 00:06:10.340
So please, watch over me from heaven!

00:06:12.460 --> 00:06:16.100
I'll be here to keep Princess Yuki safe.

00:06:17.770 --> 00:06:18.980
Huh?

00:06:18.980 --> 00:06:21.770
Hey, that lady looks like Princess Yuki!

00:06:21.770 --> 00:06:23.040
Let's go look!

00:06:23.040 --> 00:06:24.020
Yeah!

00:06:24.020 --> 00:06:25.670
That's not good!

00:06:25.670 --> 00:06:26.450
We have to leave!

00:06:37.740 --> 00:06:39.370
Hold perfectly still. Don't move.

00:06:43.790 --> 00:06:44.750
They're gone.

00:06:45.690 --> 00:06:47.380
Y-Yeah...

00:06:47.980 --> 00:06:49.280
Okay, let's get back to the palace—

00:06:49.280 --> 00:06:51.140
<i>Your opponent is requesting a match.</i>

00:06:51.550 --> 00:06:53.410
<i>Will you join the battle?</i>

00:06:54.260 --> 00:06:55.830
A theurgear game?

00:06:55.830 --> 00:06:57.450
Looks like it. Let's go.

00:06:57.450 --> 00:06:59.520
<i>Beat ten opponents in a row and win a prize.</i>

00:07:00.340 --> 00:07:01.310
Joshua!

00:07:02.220 --> 00:07:03.260
Please!

00:07:04.670 --> 00:07:06.280
This one's pretty good.

00:07:06.280 --> 00:07:08.180
He's almost to nine in a row!

00:07:10.700 --> 00:07:12.660
Passion and will!

00:07:11.040 --> 00:07:12.660
Get 'em, Joshua!

00:07:14.050 --> 00:07:16.870
He never does fight pretty, does he?

00:07:16.870 --> 00:07:19.910
And he calls himself a 
member of the Royal Order?

00:07:22.970 --> 00:07:23.920
Heck yeah!

00:07:23.920 --> 00:07:25.210
Just one more to go!

00:07:25.210 --> 00:07:26.840
Go get 'em, Joshua!

00:07:27.430 --> 00:07:29.890
Joshua Ingram of the Order.

00:07:29.890 --> 00:07:32.720
Lone son of the venerable Ingram family.

00:07:33.920 --> 00:07:37.430
You expect to protect Princess Yuki 
with such meager talents?

00:07:38.100 --> 00:07:38.850
Who are you?!

00:07:38.990 --> 00:07:40.050
Fight!

00:07:45.140 --> 00:07:45.980
So close, yet so far.

00:07:51.690 --> 00:07:53.660
We have a last-minute change to the agenda.

00:07:54.050 --> 00:07:59.160
Let us first examine the report from 
Grand Master Harold Miller of the Royal Order.

00:07:59.160 --> 00:08:01.600
Secret talks with the Empire of Grandiga

00:08:01.600 --> 00:08:06.020
took place three days ago 
near the Wister border.

00:08:06.600 --> 00:08:08.600
What did they have to say?

00:08:09.500 --> 00:08:11.260
They seem amicable.

00:08:11.610 --> 00:08:14.800
We should be able to renew 
the non-aggression pact without issue.

00:08:16.210 --> 00:08:17.550
Excellent work.

00:08:17.550 --> 00:08:19.160
Oh, right, Harold.

00:08:19.160 --> 00:08:20.560
Pass these on, won't you?

00:08:22.930 --> 00:08:26.250
They're the birthday presents 
everyone brought for me.

00:08:26.710 --> 00:08:30.410
Unlike our kingdom, I hear 
that the Empire has poor soil,

00:08:30.410 --> 00:08:33.430
and that the people there are struggling.

00:08:34.030 --> 00:08:34.700
Indeed...

00:08:35.100 --> 00:08:38.330
Please offer them these gifts 
as a token of our friendship.

00:08:39.970 --> 00:08:42.500
If I may be so bold, 
could I make one comment?

00:08:43.250 --> 00:08:44.210
What is it?

00:08:44.210 --> 00:08:48.020
Your Highness, just what 
do you think the Empire is?

00:08:49.370 --> 00:08:51.370
They're our neighboring country.

00:08:51.370 --> 00:08:54.060
You're supposed to help your neighbors 
when they're struggling, aren't you?

00:08:54.060 --> 00:08:55.500
We need to get along.

00:08:56.090 --> 00:08:57.330
One more question, then.

00:08:57.820 --> 00:09:01.140
What do you think of 
the state of this country?

00:09:02.390 --> 00:09:05.480
The monarchy was adopted as a necessary evil

00:09:05.480 --> 00:09:07.650
when our ancestors first came to this planet.

00:09:07.650 --> 00:09:09.860
The environment was still 
unforgiving back then,

00:09:09.860 --> 00:09:12.810
and the people sought a symbol 
to give them strength.

00:09:13.750 --> 00:09:17.730
But now, we have strong roots in this world.

00:09:18.080 --> 00:09:19.990
The monarchy is a relic of the past.

00:09:20.250 --> 00:09:22.490
Some might say that 
it is no longer necessary.

00:09:23.820 --> 00:09:26.600
We will manage the negotiations 
with the Empire.

00:09:26.600 --> 00:09:28.710
Kindly stay quiet and let us do our jobs.

00:09:28.710 --> 00:09:30.590
You! How dare you insult the princess?!

00:09:37.610 --> 00:09:38.720
Who are you?

00:09:39.080 --> 00:09:40.430
Yuni Vanquish.

00:09:40.880 --> 00:09:43.850
I serve the margrave of the State of Wister.

00:09:44.530 --> 00:09:47.740
Yuni, I understand why 
you feel the way you do,

00:09:48.150 --> 00:09:51.050
but as a member of the royal family,

00:09:51.050 --> 00:09:53.860
and as the daughter of my 
late father and mother,

00:09:53.860 --> 00:09:55.590
there are things on which 
I will not compromise.

00:09:56.580 --> 00:09:58.530
I want to make everyone in this kingdom—

00:09:58.530 --> 00:10:00.680
to make everyone on this planet smile.

00:10:01.350 --> 00:10:05.620
To accomplish that, I think there 
must be things that only I can do.

00:10:06.070 --> 00:10:07.120
And what are those?

00:10:07.360 --> 00:10:09.380
Oh, I actually don't know yet!

00:10:10.590 --> 00:10:13.000
You'll help me think of them, 
won't you, Yuni?

00:10:14.420 --> 00:10:17.420
Hey, what kind of place 
is the State of Wister?

00:10:18.010 --> 00:10:20.890
I've never left the city!

00:10:25.580 --> 00:10:28.770
I respect your decision, Your Highness.

00:10:30.130 --> 00:10:31.770
I apologize for my insolence.

00:10:32.350 --> 00:10:34.040
I must apologize,

00:10:34.040 --> 00:10:36.400
and I ask that you forgive her, for my sake.

00:10:36.960 --> 00:10:40.060
"Put Princess Yuki's character to the test."

00:10:40.430 --> 00:10:44.740
That was the order we 
received from our master.

00:10:44.740 --> 00:10:47.090
Oh, it's no problem.

00:10:47.090 --> 00:10:47.790
Are you...

00:10:48.240 --> 00:10:51.030
Indeed, I am Yuni's twin brother.

00:10:51.350 --> 00:10:52.920
My name is Lune Vanquish.

00:10:53.160 --> 00:10:56.690
I brought them to the 
capital at my discretion.

00:10:56.690 --> 00:11:01.460
I believe their piloting skills are a 
match for any member of the Order.

00:11:01.460 --> 00:11:03.680
Isn't that just great, Joshua?

00:11:04.160 --> 00:11:04.930
Yes.

00:11:09.760 --> 00:11:12.460
Don't you do anything besides work?

00:11:12.460 --> 00:11:13.690
Come out with us for once.

00:11:14.350 --> 00:11:16.570
You haven't paid a proper visit 
back home either, have you?

00:11:17.070 --> 00:11:18.430
Think about your poor wife.

00:11:18.430 --> 00:11:20.370
Don't worry about me.

00:11:20.370 --> 00:11:22.950
You should focus on teaching 
your subordinates some manners.

00:11:24.520 --> 00:11:28.020
Joshua wasn't happy, was he?

00:11:28.020 --> 00:11:29.650
Of course he wasn't.

00:11:29.650 --> 00:11:33.740
He and Princess Yuki practically 
grew up as brother and sister.

00:11:34.450 --> 00:11:36.640
They both lost their parents, too.

00:11:38.500 --> 00:11:39.720
Twelve years ago,

00:11:39.940 --> 00:11:42.020
while developing the new chrars.

00:11:42.020 --> 00:11:43.470
That incident...

00:11:44.310 --> 00:11:48.740
The energy source which makes our 
civilization possible, chrarslapis,

00:11:48.740 --> 00:11:51.600
is a special ore that can 
only be found on this planet.

00:11:51.820 --> 00:11:56.570
The dedication of the late royal 
couple to keep their people fed

00:11:56.570 --> 00:11:59.500
led to attempts to develop more 
efficient forms of chrars.

00:11:59.860 --> 00:12:00.860
But...

00:12:01.110 --> 00:12:02.740
It's ironic.

00:12:02.740 --> 00:12:06.620
That hope of theirs was 
the death of both of them.

00:12:06.970 --> 00:12:09.050
Listen, about Joshua...

00:12:09.450 --> 00:12:12.140
He won't listen to anything I say.

00:12:12.140 --> 00:12:13.640
I can't stop him.

00:12:13.640 --> 00:12:14.500
Harold.

00:12:14.750 --> 00:12:17.050
I'll fulfill my duty.

00:12:18.900 --> 00:12:19.760
What about you?

00:12:21.850 --> 00:12:25.010
How many of the new chrars can 
you prepare before we head out?

00:12:25.260 --> 00:12:26.590
Three.

00:12:26.590 --> 00:12:29.160
I'll have them sent 
the minute they're finished.

00:12:29.740 --> 00:12:30.960
What do you want?

00:12:31.510 --> 00:12:34.900
You insulted the princess—insulted Yuki.

00:12:35.290 --> 00:12:37.840
I'm going to make you pay!

00:12:45.820 --> 00:12:47.420
I win.

00:12:48.370 --> 00:12:49.910
Please try a bit harder next time.

00:12:50.440 --> 00:12:53.790
Chess is an excellent way to 
nurture strategic thinking.

00:12:53.790 --> 00:12:55.870
Is that something I need?

00:12:55.870 --> 00:12:58.290
You are technically 
the ruler of this country.

00:12:58.950 --> 00:13:01.800
Everything you learn will 
help you in that cause.

00:13:02.060 --> 00:13:03.400
Yeah, yeah...

00:13:04.790 --> 00:13:05.840
Princess Yuki.

00:13:09.400 --> 00:13:10.430
Two against one?

00:13:10.910 --> 00:13:12.380
You must not think very highly of us.

00:13:12.380 --> 00:13:14.310
Let's use capture the flag rules.

00:13:14.940 --> 00:13:16.350
Bring it on.

00:13:17.420 --> 00:13:18.060
A duel?

00:13:18.600 --> 00:13:20.570
Did Joshua make the challenge?

00:13:20.570 --> 00:13:21.200
Yes.

00:13:21.740 --> 00:13:23.950
It's merely a mock battle in the simulator.

00:13:23.950 --> 00:13:26.070
It's part of their training, but...

00:13:26.350 --> 00:13:29.070
But why would he do that?

00:13:31.110 --> 00:13:32.870
Good morning.

00:13:32.870 --> 00:13:35.210
We've prepared you a front 
row seat, Your Highness.

00:13:42.150 --> 00:13:43.630
Joshua...

00:13:45.640 --> 00:13:48.390
If anyone hurts Yuki, I'll make them pay!

00:13:49.550 --> 00:13:50.890
He's doing this for me?

00:13:51.940 --> 00:13:53.890
Don't come crying to me later 
if you don't like the result.

00:13:54.160 --> 00:13:55.950
<i>Now displaying battlefield.</i>

00:13:56.720 --> 00:13:57.650
To...

00:13:58.210 --> 00:14:02.650
"Tokyo." A city located on our old homeworld.

00:14:03.860 --> 00:14:06.420
It's all blocky and ugly.

00:14:06.420 --> 00:14:08.030
A simple explanation of the rules:

00:14:08.230 --> 00:14:11.030
The team that seizes the other's flag wins.

00:14:11.700 --> 00:14:14.500
<i>Makeup of each team's theurgear platoon:</i>

00:14:14.500 --> 00:14:16.540
<i>One Gard.</i>

00:14:16.540 --> 00:14:18.620
<i>Two Squires.</i>

00:14:18.620 --> 00:14:20.580
<i>Two Krivanovs.</i>

00:14:20.860 --> 00:14:22.340
<i>No time limit.</i>

00:14:22.880 --> 00:14:24.310
<i>Visual range combat.</i>

00:14:24.310 --> 00:14:27.900
<i>All units except the leader unit
 will be controlled remotely.</i>

00:14:28.920 --> 00:14:30.720
Both sides, begin!

00:14:31.720 --> 00:14:32.720
Let's go!

00:14:32.980 --> 00:14:34.150
Act fast and win!

00:14:34.150 --> 00:14:34.850
Follow me!

00:14:39.880 --> 00:14:43.610
Let's see... leave one unit 
in front of the flag...

00:14:43.840 --> 00:14:44.820
And the other...

00:14:45.520 --> 00:14:46.820
What a pain in the neck!

00:14:51.460 --> 00:14:53.030
Three enemy units approaching.

00:14:54.470 --> 00:14:55.540
Smog?

00:14:55.980 --> 00:14:57.610
How by-the-book.

00:14:57.610 --> 00:14:59.040
Lune, how are the traps coming?

00:14:59.310 --> 00:15:00.800
All in place.

00:15:00.800 --> 00:15:01.960
Leave it all to me.

00:15:01.960 --> 00:15:03.240
Two against one?

00:15:03.240 --> 00:15:04.740
That's not fair!

00:15:04.740 --> 00:15:06.550
That's how Joshua wanted it.

00:15:06.550 --> 00:15:09.220
He wants to overcome 
the handicap to prove his skill.

00:15:19.350 --> 00:15:22.020
Y-Yeah, that figures...

00:15:22.240 --> 00:15:23.520
But I won't make it easy!

00:15:44.990 --> 00:15:47.090
Two units withdrew, eh?

00:15:50.340 --> 00:15:52.580
Lune, you handle things over there!

00:15:59.170 --> 00:16:01.420
One unit down, two to go!

00:16:09.220 --> 00:16:11.490
That's just one... a decoy?

00:16:14.170 --> 00:16:15.370
Secret's out already?

00:16:15.370 --> 00:16:16.680
Then let's go for it!

00:16:18.660 --> 00:16:21.830
I anticipated this.

00:16:21.830 --> 00:16:23.120
Yeah, yeah.

00:16:23.120 --> 00:16:26.290
Then I'll just have to force my way through!

00:16:36.080 --> 00:16:37.010
Need to get that one first...

00:16:57.130 --> 00:16:58.700
M-Make it in time!

00:17:03.490 --> 00:17:06.750
Aside from the leader unit, 
there should be two enemies left.

00:17:07.280 --> 00:17:08.500
Proceed with caution!

00:17:09.150 --> 00:17:09.970
Darn it!

00:17:09.970 --> 00:17:11.370
It's two on one!

00:17:11.370 --> 00:17:12.880
I can help him, can't I?

00:17:14.280 --> 00:17:15.380
As you wish.

00:17:15.750 --> 00:17:17.310
<i>Joshua, can you hear me?</i>

00:17:17.310 --> 00:17:18.890
Y-Yuki?

00:17:19.460 --> 00:17:21.520
<i>Stay underground and keep moving south!</i>

00:17:21.520 --> 00:17:23.560
<i>That should get you around behind their flag!</i>

00:17:23.750 --> 00:17:24.660
Right!

00:17:24.660 --> 00:17:27.180
W-Wait, this position is perfect...

00:17:27.180 --> 00:17:29.060
<i>Perfect? For what?</i>

00:17:30.400 --> 00:17:32.280
Give me a break already!

00:17:32.520 --> 00:17:33.530
I don't have a choice.

00:17:33.870 --> 00:17:36.810
Harold, pull up a diagram of that building.

00:17:37.900 --> 00:17:39.560
As you wish, but what are you...

00:17:42.610 --> 00:17:43.410
I see...

00:17:45.270 --> 00:17:46.580
No defenses?

00:17:46.580 --> 00:17:48.450
No resistance, either?

00:17:48.450 --> 00:17:49.630
What in the...

00:17:49.800 --> 00:17:51.480
<i>Harold! Now!</i>

00:18:01.560 --> 00:18:02.850
Can they do that?!

00:18:03.260 --> 00:18:05.040
Impossible. The flag...

00:18:05.040 --> 00:18:05.850
...was buried?

00:18:06.030 --> 00:18:07.770
Now our opponents can't get it.

00:18:07.770 --> 00:18:08.730
Problem solved, right?

00:18:09.400 --> 00:18:13.380
Harold, we have one more 
ally machine, don't we?

00:18:13.380 --> 00:18:14.490
I'm going to use that.

00:18:15.170 --> 00:18:15.990
Understood.

00:18:37.380 --> 00:18:38.800
<i>Joshua, can you hear me?</i>

00:18:38.800 --> 00:18:40.050
<i>Everything's ready up here!</i>

00:18:40.660 --> 00:18:42.450
Roger that! I'm on my way!

00:18:51.770 --> 00:18:52.650
That sound...

00:18:54.900 --> 00:18:55.830
What?!

00:18:56.840 --> 00:18:58.720
Water's flowing out from underground?

00:18:58.720 --> 00:19:03.330
Yes. The unit working on 
its own must have set it up.

00:19:03.600 --> 00:19:07.590
That culvert was likely used to 
channel the city's waste water.

00:19:07.590 --> 00:19:10.290
Joshua destroyed one of the weirs.

00:19:10.290 --> 00:19:12.210
The underground area quickly flooded,

00:19:12.210 --> 00:19:13.790
and the only way out for the water was...

00:19:17.220 --> 00:19:20.340
Passion and will!

00:19:21.290 --> 00:19:23.170
That's what Joshua was after?

00:19:23.170 --> 00:19:27.600
And you happened to tilt that 
tower to a perfect angle.

00:19:28.540 --> 00:19:32.100
But it's no surprise you're so in sync, 
seeing as you grew up together.

00:19:34.850 --> 00:19:36.190
Heck yeah!

00:19:44.200 --> 00:19:46.230
The winner is Team Joshua.

00:19:46.700 --> 00:19:48.650
The training is now over.

00:19:53.230 --> 00:19:55.380
Are you certain about this?

00:19:55.380 --> 00:19:58.300
Permitting the Royal Order 
to go to the border...

00:19:58.550 --> 00:19:59.510
Yes.

00:19:59.510 --> 00:20:04.850
Harold said we should send a delegation
 to the Empire out in the open this time.

00:20:05.530 --> 00:20:06.260
See?

00:20:10.910 --> 00:20:13.330
See you later, Yuni, Lune!

00:20:13.920 --> 00:20:16.120
Well, I should be going, too.

00:20:16.650 --> 00:20:19.310
Joshua is a part of the delegation, as well.

00:20:20.580 --> 00:20:23.580
The list was in the documents 
I gave you earlier, I believe.

00:20:23.580 --> 00:20:24.570
No way!

00:20:24.570 --> 00:20:25.520
Yuki!

00:20:31.150 --> 00:20:32.410
It's a bit belated,

00:20:33.060 --> 00:20:35.540
but I wish you a very happy birthday.

00:20:40.450 --> 00:20:41.800
Quit acting all cool.

00:20:41.800 --> 00:20:43.160
It's not like you.

00:20:43.510 --> 00:20:44.300
Hey!

00:20:45.980 --> 00:20:47.690
This is an order from your princess.

00:20:47.690 --> 00:20:51.930
Show her the outside world in my stead.

00:20:53.290 --> 00:20:54.780
So that's the deal, is it?

00:20:55.490 --> 00:20:57.560
Got it. See you soon!

00:21:09.240 --> 00:21:12.080
Make us proud, Joshua!

00:21:21.260 --> 00:21:22.290
Joshua...

00:23:00.010 --> 00:23:01.620
We're currently passing through Hariant.

00:23:03.280 --> 00:23:05.990
Are you sure about this, Joshua?

00:23:05.990 --> 00:23:06.650
Yes.

00:23:06.890 --> 00:23:09.700
I will protect Yuki's smile...

00:23:09.700 --> 00:23:11.280
with passion and will!

00:23:14.160 --> 00:23:17.040
This is the current state at the border.

00:23:18.120 --> 00:23:20.660
To spare Princess Yuki tremendous heartache,

00:23:20.660 --> 00:23:23.610
we need to settle this ourselves.

00:23:35.140 --> 00:23:40.210
<b><i>The Truth of the War</i></b>
